;
; How Solstice files an event, in MYRA: its number, its start and finish in
; seconds since 1970 (twelve digits reach the last second of year 9999),
; how many days apart it repeats (0: once) and how many minutes before its
; start its notice is due. The model says what the values may mean
; (solstice_rules.h SO5); this says whether they make a record.
^ZXEVENT(event:i9) = start:i12! ^ finish:i12! ^ every:i7! ^ alarm:i4!
